---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getSite } from '../server/services/content';

const { settings } = await getSite();
const { contact, organisation } = settings;
---

<Layout title="Privacy notice" description="How Pa's Place collects, uses and protects personal information under POPIA.">
  <section class="bg-page" aria-label="Privacy notice">
    <div class="container-page pb-20 pt-10 lg:pt-14">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="t-h1 mt-2">Privacy notice</h1>
      <div class="prose-brand mt-8">
        <p>
          {organisation.legalName} (&ldquo;we&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This notice explains what personal information we collect through
          this website and what we do with it, in line with the Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA).
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">What we collect</h2>
        <ul class="ray-list space-y-2">
          <li>When you send a booking request: your name, email address, phone number, dates, party size and any notes you add.</li>
          <li>When you send a message: your name, email address, phone number (if given) and your message.</li>
          <li>We do not collect card or banking details on this website, and we do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>
          To answer your question, to manage your booking, and to keep the accounting records the law requires of us. We do not sell your
          information or share it with anyone for marketing.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiries are kept for as long as we need them to help you. Booking records are kept for as long as financial record-keeping
          rules require, and then deleted.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">Photographs</h2>
        <p>
          We only publish photographs in which a child can be recognised when a parent or guardian has agreed in writing. If you appear in
          a photograph on this site and would like it removed, tell us and we will take it down.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You may ask to see the information we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or object to how we use it. You may also
          complain to the Information Regulator (South Africa) at inforegulator.org.za.
        </p>

        <h2 class="t-h3 !mt-10">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          {contact.email && <>Email <a class="link" href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a></>}
          {contact.email && contact.phone && ' or '}
          {contact.phone && <>call <a class="link tnum" href={`tel:${contact.phoneLink || contact.phone}`}>{contact.phone}</a></>}.
          {contact.address && <span> Our address is {contact.address}.</span>}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
